<title>GERMANY: MOTOR RACING-SCHUMACHER A FATHER.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-SCHUMACHER A FATHER.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Double world champion Michael Schumacher became a father on Thursday.</p>
<p>The St Josef hospital in the west German town of Wipperfuerth said Schumacher was present at the birth of daughter Gina Maria.</p>
<p>The Ferrari driver's wife Corinna and baby were in good health.</p>
</text>
